      "headingRaw": "Seven-character-regular-verseWangWeiHARMONIZINGAPOEMBYPALACE-ATTENDANTGUO",
      "translationRaw": "HighbeyondthethickwallatowershineswithsunsetWherepeachandplumarebloomingandthewillowcottonflies。Youhaveheardinyourofficethecourt-belloftwilight；Birdsfindperches，officialsheadforhome。Yourmorning-jadewilltinkleasyouthreadthegoldenpalace；YouwillbringthewordofHeavenfromtheclosinggatesatnight。AndIshouldservetherewithyou；butbeingfullofyears，Ihavetakenoffofficialrobesandamrestingfrommytroubles。",
